  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "An adept swimmer at both the front crawl and breast stroke. Easily overtakes the best human swimmers.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "An adept swimmer at both the front crawl and breast stroke. Easily overtakes the best human swimmers.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Swims powerfully using all the muscles in its body. It can even overtake champion swimmers.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "This strong and skilled swimmer is even capable of crossing the Pacific Ocean just by kicking.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Although an energetic, skilled swimmer that uses all of its muscles, it lives on dry land.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can use its well-developed arms and legs to run on the surface of the water for a split second.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "POLIWRATH’s highly developed, brawny muscles never grow fatigued, however much it exercises. It is so tirelessly strong, this POKéMON can swim back and forth across the Pacific Ocean without effort.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "POLIWRATH’s highly developed, brawny muscles never grow fatigued, however much it exercises. It is so tirelessly strong, this POKéMON can swim back and forth across the Pacific Ocean without effort.",
